flowchart LR
    DH[Workflow Source DB]
    ALB[API Gateway ALB]
    ORCH[Orchestrator EKS]
    WORKER[Worker Pool]
    SQS[SQS Queues]
    DB[PostgreSQL]
    KAFKA[Kafka Topics]
    EXT[External System]

    DH -->|Read Data| WORKER
    ALB -->|Request| ORCH
    ORCH <-->|State| DB
    ORCH -->|Delegate| SQS
    SQS -->|Process| WORKER
    WORKER -->|Callback| ORCH
    ORCH -->|Publish| KAFKA
    KAFKA --> EXT

    style DH fill:#ff9966
    style ORCH fill:#66b3ff
    style WORKER fill:#66b3ff
    style ALB fill:#66b3ff
    style SQS fill:#66b3ff
    style DB fill:#66b3ff
    style KAFKA fill:#66ff66
    style EXT fill:#66ff66
